+{
+  "version": 8,
+  "metadata": {
+    "test": {
+      "description": "Patterned line on globe, pole to pole: the pattern must follow the line thickness scaling towards the poles. Source capped to maxzoom 0 to keep the line in a single tile, since pattern phase restarts at tile boundaries and the line crosses the tile corner at 0/0 mid-frame."
